# Customisation

*How-to guide.*

Pack-specific styling knobs for {{humanName}}.

## Colour

<!-- Document whether the icons use currentColor, fixed colours, or a mix.
     If currentColor:                                                    -->

All {{humanName}} icons use `currentColor`. Set the colour via Tailwind text utilities:

```blade
<x-ichava::icon name="{{packageName}}::heart" class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500" />
```

With the fluent helper:

```blade
{{ ichava('{{packageName}}::heart')->color('#ef4444')->class('w-6 h-6') }}
```

<!-- If the pack has fixed colours, document the exceptions here. -->

## Size

The bundled SVGs are <!-- e.g. 24×24 with viewBox="0 0 24 24" -->. Use any width/height utility:

```blade
<x-ichava::icon name="{{packageName}}::home" class="w-4 h-4" />     {{-- small --}}
<x-ichava::icon name="{{packageName}}::home" class="w-6 h-6" />     {{-- default --}}
<x-ichava::icon name="{{packageName}}::home" class="w-12 h-12" />   {{-- large --}}
```

## Pack-specific knobs

<!-- Document any custom Blade attributes the pack respects, e.g.

   <x-ichava::icon name="{{packageName}}::home" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6" />

   ...if your {{axisPlural}} have a stroke-width concept. -->

## Default class globally

In `config/ichava/core.php`:

```php
'components' => [
    'enabled'       => true,
    'default_class' => 'w-5 h-5',
],
```

Per-component `class="..."` overrides the default.

## Accessibility

```blade
<x-ichava::icon name="{{packageName}}::trash" aria-label="Delete" class="w-5 h-5" />
```

Decorative icons (next to a text label) can omit the label, the renderer adds `aria-hidden="true"` automatically.

## Adding your own icons

Relocated from the README, which is now a slim pointer.

1. Place your SVG files in `resources/assets/svg/files/`.
2. For multi-{{axis}} icons, organise by {{axis}}: `files/regular/`, `files/solid/`, and so on.
3. Record the metadata in `resources/assets/svg/config.json`.
4. Clear the cache: `php artisan ichava::ichava-core.cache clear`.

### Icon guidelines

- Valid SVG, and nothing that the sanitiser will strip -- see core's security model.
- **Drop `width` and `height`.** The component supplies them, and an SVG carrying both alongside a `viewBox` ignores the size it is asked for.
- Use `currentColor` for `fill` and `stroke`, or the icon cannot be recoloured.
- Lowercase, hyphenated filenames: `arrow-left.svg`.

## Browsing what this pack ships

```bash
php artisan ichava::ichava-core.info icons --package={{packageName}}
```

For the visual browser, install [`ichava/browser`](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/browser/) and visit `/{prefix}/icons`.

